  "remarks": "This posthumous edition represents Martin West's final work on the Iliad, incorporating his lifetime of Homeric scholarship. The text includes significant new readings based on papyrus discoveries from the late 20th century. Particularly valuable for its comprehensive treatment of textual variants and manuscript tradition. Note: Some reviewers suggest the critical apparatus may be too detailed for undergraduate use.",

